From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 12:41:36 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Revert "arm64: dts: qcom: kaanapali-oneplus-iceland: link
 the rear camera to its flash"

With flash-leds on the rear sensor, v4l2_async_register_subdev_sensor()
adds both flash LEDs as async connections of the sensor's notifier. The
LEDs only become V4L2 subdevices through v4l2-flash, and our config has
CONFIG_V4L2_FLASH_LED_CLASS unset, so leds-qcom-flash never registers
them: the sensor's notifier never completes, CAMSS never reaches its
complete callback, no /dev/v4l-subdev* nodes or sensor entities are
created, and libcamera finds no camera at all (q91b: "No sensor found
for /dev/media0", 0 / 20 captures; front and rear, since CAMSS registers
the subdevice nodes only when every sensor is bound).

Take the link out. It can come back together with
CONFIG_V4L2_FLASH_LED_CLASS (and a test that the flash LED subdevices
register before CAMSS completes).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali-oneplus-iceland.dts | 5 ++---
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali-oneplus-iceland.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali-oneplus-iceland.dts
index ca276839c010..7ac40870b192 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali-oneplus-iceland.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali-oneplus-iceland.dts
@@ -1367,7 +1367,6 @@ camera@36 {
 		rotation = <0>;
 
 		lens-focus = <&vcm>;
-		flash-leds = <&rear_flash_yellow>, <&rear_flash_white>;
 
 		port {
 			cam_rear_out: endpoint {
@@ -1715,7 +1714,7 @@ &pmh0101_flash {
 	status = "okay";
 
 	/* two dies, each on two channels (stock: 500 mA torch, 2 A flash, 1.28 s per die) */
-	rear_flash_yellow: led-0 {
+	led-0 {
 		function = LED_FUNCTION_FLASH;
 		function-enumerator = <0>;
 		color = <LED_COLOR_ID_YELLOW>;
@@ -1725,7 +1724,7 @@ rear_flash_yellow: led-0 {
 		flash-max-timeout-us = <1280000>;
 	};
 
-	rear_flash_white: led-1 {
+	led-1 {
 		function = LED_FUNCTION_FLASH;
 		function-enumerator = <1>;
 		color = <LED_COLOR_ID_WHITE>;
